&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;The
proposed development, by reason of its isolated and piecemeal form on a
prominent frontage parcel, would fail to optimise the use of the site and would
not demonstrate a comprehensive approach to development having regard to the
redevelopment potential of surrounding land. The proposal would therefore fail
to make effective and efficient use of land in a highly accessible location and
would conflict with Section 11 of the National Planning Policy Framework,
Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies HO3 and GR10 of the Harrow
Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
